              <li><a href="#verbs">Verb Conjugation & Grammar Roulette</a></li>
              <li><a href="#conversation">Conversation Starter Wheels</a></li>
              <li>
                <a href="#pronunciation">Pronunciation & Listening Practice</a>
              </li>
              <li><a href="#by-level">Wheel Ideas by Proficiency Level</a></li>
              <li><a href="#self-learners">Ideas for Self-Learners</a></li>
              <li><a href="#setup">How to Set Up Your Language Wheel</a></li>
              <li><a href="#faq">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li>
              <li><a href="#conclusion">Final Thoughts</a></li>
            </ol>
